	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_13 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_13_rew")>><<money 420>>奶泡绵密香甜，罗宾开心地把昨天帮高街杂货店代售剩下的劳务费分了一半给你。<<else>>热牛奶冒着细密白泡，罗宾捧着杯子冲你露出甜甜的笑意。<</if>><span class="green">香浓的热可可温暖了你们两个人的手心。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|Bedroom]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	火苗稍微旺了一点，锅边溅起几滴温牛奶。<span class="red">你忙拧小炉火拿抹布擦净锅沿。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压手再慢搅热牛奶 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link "筛可可粉暖手 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-13">>
<<if (($willpower or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_robin_12_list'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 420 or ($science or 0) gte 230>>
