<<else>>
	小铜筛晃得急了些，一撮可可粉落在了杯沿外。<span class="red"><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>笑着帮你将杯沿擦干净。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
